* text=auto eol=lf

*.blade.php diff=html
*.css diff=css
*.html diff=html
*.md diff=markdown
*.php diff=php

/.github export-ignore
CHANGELOG.md export-ignore
.styleci.yml export-ignore

# GitHub language stats (Linguist): exclude static/legacy assets so the
# repo is reported by its real source code (PHP, Blade, resources/js).
/public/** linguist-vendored
/resources/css/legacy/** linguist-vendored
